g above the 50,000 line before 3000 BC or place the achievement of the half million later than 1000 BC. From this latter point a low rate of increase is all that is needed to bring the total to 1m by AD 1 and 2m by AD 1000." <br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 892, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 827})
