th Greeks representing ca. 5% of the total.<br>Korotaev and Khaltourina\'s estimated population dynamics of Egypt 300-1900 CE. Korotaev and Khaltourina\'s data (Egypt only)300 BCE: 3,000,000200 BCE: 4,000,000100 BCE: 2,500,0001 CE: 3,500,000<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 990, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 905})
