so their fighting strength, even going so far as never to use the same trail twice, if possible, in approaching their homes. For these reasons an air of complete mystery surrounds the whole region, [193] and the casual white invader stands no chance of obtaining accurate statistics.”\'  Jivaro political organization was fluid and decentralized. We therefore cannot confidently provide realiable proxy measures for a \'typical\' quasi-polity.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 906, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 849})
